Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.91,0:00:10.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For crying out loud...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.95,0:00:14.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is she telling us to cool our heads here for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.25,0:00:18.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leaving us alone in a place like this \Nwon't be any trouble for us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.92,0:00:23.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Being forbidden to use alchemy—\Nit's like when we were training here that one time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.63,0:00:28.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you think that maybe Sensei doesn't feel like we've made any progress at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.22,0:00:29.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That couldn't be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:38.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just a minute! Al! Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.61,0:00:43.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't get so upset.\NYou'll fall in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.11,0:00:44.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.74,0:00:47.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.49,0:00:49.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.87,0:00:50.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.07,0:00:52.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't just "yeah" me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.91,0:00:55.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't understand the reason why you're leaving the two of them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.66,0:00:57.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,on an uninhabited island\Nall of a sudden!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.33,0:00:58.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.87,0:00:59.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.29,0:01:03.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jeez! What in the world\Nare you thinking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:05.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is good to do\Nevery now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.88,0:01:10.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's nice to stop and think things over once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.64,0:01:13.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's something those two need to do right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.98,0:01:21.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything\Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.65,0:01:26.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything,\Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.94,0:01:31.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's\NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.66,0:01:37.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that\Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.43,0:03:21.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.98,0:03:23.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Should we run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.89,0:03:26.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.86,0:03:29.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, I can't swim!\NCome to think of it,\Nneither can I.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.32,0:03:34.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right. We're not\Nthe same as we used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.11,0:03:36.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.58,0:03:46.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is fun, huh, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:47.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.13,0:03:51.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time since\Nwe've been out sightseeing like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.38,0:03:53.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sightseeing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.63,0:03:55.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's rich!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.98,0:04:08.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here, take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.61,0:04:12.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.94,0:04:14.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is an uninhabited island, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.78,0:04:19.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No electricity, no wells, no houses to shelter you from the rain,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.41,0:04:22.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and no wild animals... at least, probably not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.66,0:04:27.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For one month, you two are to\Nsurvive by yourselves on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.33,0:04:32.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, and during that time,\Nthe use of alchemy is prohibited.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.92,0:04:36.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.47,0:04:38.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll come to pick you up\Nin one month.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.05,0:04:40.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,J-Just a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.85,0:04:44.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One is all, all is one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.35,0:04:48.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you don't find\Nthe answer in one month,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:50.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sending you\Nback to Resembool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.40,0:04:51.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.24,0:04:59.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One is all, all is one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.41,0:05:03.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We understand it now,\Nbut at the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.24,0:05:07.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.79,0:05:09.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We didn't have a clue\Nwhat she was saying—not at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.85,0:05:24.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One is all, all is one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.18,0:05:28.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good grief, that auntie has given us homework that doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.69,0:05:31.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One is all, all is one.\NWhat could it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.94,0:05:36.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it a riddle?\NI don't get it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:40.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But unless we give her an answer in a month,\Nwe won't get any real training.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.78,0:05:45.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aw, jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.16,0:05:47.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How is this supposed to be alchemy training?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.00,0:05:49.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That auntie tricked us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.75,0:05:54.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.17,0:05:59.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about we get up early tomorrow and find some food?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.80,0:06:00.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.41,0:06:28.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al? You going to the bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.72,0:06:44.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:46.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can use the bathroom by yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.30,0:06:48.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You idiot! Open your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.69,0:06:59.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.28,0:07:03.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.86,0:07:05.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we run, then our training will be—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.99,0:07:06.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:11.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.88,0:07:22.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.23,0:07:38.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.44,0:07:40.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!\NRun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.94,0:07:42.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.00,0:08:05.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now what?\NDon't get lost on me, Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.72,0:08:10.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't taste good!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.18,0:08:11.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.47,0:08:15.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al! Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.48,0:08:16.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd lost you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.66,0:08:34.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a fox.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.00,0:08:39.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, there's two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.33,0:09:13.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.04,0:09:22.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.84,0:09:25.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make sure to dry off,\Nor else you'll rust.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.67,0:09:26.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.84,0:09:28.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who was that man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.63,0:09:30.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm scared! I'm scared to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.05,0:09:33.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And she said there were no wild animals here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.43,0:09:36.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something even worse than wild animals here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.10,0:09:38.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.52,0:09:40.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.31,0:09:43.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's another month before they're coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.98,0:09:47.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For the time being, we can't fight on empty stomachs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:49.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.40,0:09:51.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got food!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.11,0:09:54.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can catch it with\Nthe right kind of trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.08,0:09:59.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So...\NHow do we eat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.29,0:10:02.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We stick it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.67,0:10:03.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We stick it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.18,0:10:15.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll have to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.68,0:10:18.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! Brother, you do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.77,0:10:21.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've never killed an animal before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.52,0:10:23.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Neither have I!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.19,0:10:26.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not fair! You always force me to do the things you don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.11,0:10:27.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.45,0:10:31.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.37,0:10:35.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away from us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.58,0:10:43.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.05,0:10:49.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?\NYou're hurt pretty bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.51,0:10:51.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That damned fox!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.01,0:10:59.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go? That bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.22,0:11:01.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.94,0:11:10.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It has children.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.61,0:11:13.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if she's their mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.28,0:11:14.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.12,0:11:23.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's give up on meat\Nand go for fish...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.01,0:11:40.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if you can eat fox...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.81,0:11:42.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.27,0:11:45.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.69,0:11:46.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.11,0:11:48.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Food!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.98,0:11:51.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We humbly partake!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.76,0:12:14.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.89,0:12:26.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.81,0:12:28.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?\NYow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.31,0:12:30.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.36,0:12:30.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow-ow-ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.94,0:12:33.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.57,0:12:35.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't give me "what is this?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.32,0:12:39.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't dig right in just \Nbecause you're hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.95,0:12:39.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.49,0:12:41.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...\NYour handprint is right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.03,0:12:43.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take a close look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.79,0:12:45.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.91,0:12:48.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure enough, someone's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.42,0:12:50.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here? You don't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.67,0:12:56.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's possible that Sensei brought them here for the same reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.51,0:12:59.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.64,0:13:03.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go check around. We'll find something to eat while we're at it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.86,0:13:14.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way we're giving up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.15,0:13:16.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Twenty-eight more days!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.45,0:14:07.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.29,0:14:11.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did we come here for, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.17,0:14:13.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Beats me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.73,0:14:34.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What would happen\Nif we died here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.06,0:14:36.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.73,0:14:39.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry and Grandma\Nwould grieve for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.86,0:14:43.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's still a lot of\Nthings I want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.86,0:14:47.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All of this... What does it\Nhave to do with alchemy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.70,0:14:51.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've had enough!\NI want to go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.55,0:15:04.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where is he?\N{\i1}This guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.06,0:15:14.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I found some food for Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.19,0:15:21.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!\NCome look!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.53,0:15:25.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother? I wonder what's the matter...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.57,0:15:26.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You called, Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.82,0:15:27.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.16,0:15:29.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then who was that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.39,0:15:48.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.91,0:16:08.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A cicada?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.58,0:16:13.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I get it...\N{\i1}It's dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.38,0:16:18.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Death...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.46,0:16:23.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When you die,\N{\i1}this is what happens...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.94,0:16:41.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go of Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.61,0:16:47.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go of Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.10,0:17:17.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We talked about what would happen if we died here, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.85,0:17:20.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. Everyone would grieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.31,0:17:24.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, that's the subjective part.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.69,0:17:27.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looking at it objectively,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.69,0:17:30.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if I died, the world would keep on going \Nas if nothing had happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.12,0:17:32.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your existence is a tiny one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.78,0:17:33.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't call me small!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.91,0:17:34.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ee-yow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.62,0:17:41.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, if I, with my small existence,\Nwere to die, my body would still remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.21,0:17:44.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Water, carbon, ammonia, lime,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.42,0:17:49.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,phosphorous, saltpeter, salt, sulfur, magnesium, fluorine, manganese, and aluminum, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.97,0:17:50.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.97,0:17:55.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That and a handful of other elemental compounds are all that I am, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.64,0:17:57.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My body, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.35,0:18:04.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm fated to be\Nbroken down by bacteria\Nand become nourishment for plants.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.23,0:18:09.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then those plants will raise grazing animals...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.40,0:18:12.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And the grazing animals will feed carnivorous animals...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.03,0:18:17.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Without even being aware of it, we naturally go on circulating.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.50,0:18:20.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.96,0:18:26.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a giant flow that\Nwe can't see with our eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.71,0:18:30.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whether you call it the universe, or the world, I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.88,0:18:35.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but, Al, you and I are one little part within the larger flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.31,0:18:38.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One within all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.47,0:18:42.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, all of the ones have to\Ncome together for the all to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.60,0:18:46.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The world follows the flow of\Ngreater laws that we can't even imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.27,0:18:51.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We learn that flow,\Nbreak it down, and reconstruct it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.28,0:18:55.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And that's alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.79,0:19:00.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thirty days!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.29,0:19:02.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got breakfast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.75,0:19:05.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is the appointed day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.29,0:19:09.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One is all, all is one.\NLet's hear your answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.96,0:19:11.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"All" is the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.59,0:19:12.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"One" is me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.89,0:19:25.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.06,0:19:27.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll move on to real training.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.65,0:19:29.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.70,0:19:37.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess that guy isn't here after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.49,0:19:38.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's okay, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.95,0:19:42.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We more or less got what Sensei was trying to tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.58,0:19:43.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.50,0:19:47.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Back then,\Nwe arrived at the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.55,0:19:51.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But still, that alone wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.59,0:19:56.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The truth is, back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.80,0:20:00.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we should have realized that\Ntransmuting Mom was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.23,0:20:07.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It could be that everything \Nwe're about to do is, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.32,0:20:11.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Sensei would agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.46,0:20:28.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you remembered?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.92,0:20:29.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.34,0:20:31.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you realize it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.30,0:20:36.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, Sensei, what you're trying to tell us is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.01,0:20:40.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's true that we did try to transmute our mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.18,0:20:43.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The way we are now\Nis the outcome of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.89,0:20:48.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, that is precisely why\Nwe want to get everything back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.56,0:20:52.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You intend to get back through error that which you lost through error?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.94,0:20:57.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe it is wrong of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.45,0:21:03.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...\Nif that's the case,\Nwhat are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.66,0:21:08.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going to move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.46,0:21:10.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.09,0:21:13.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,still alive, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.21,0:21:16.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And that's enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.42,0:21:18.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.30,0:21:22.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.64,0:21:24.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is someone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.93,0:21:26.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.56,0:21:29.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hasn't someone been living on this island since long ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.85,0:21:32.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think it could be that\Nmasked man from before?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.65,0:21:33.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That couldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.94,0:21:35.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The reason being, that was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.53,0:21:40.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What do you mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.82,0:21:43.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just in case, I had him keep watch, since I couldn't let you die on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.53,0:21:45.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-So then...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.83,0:21:49.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently, that doesn't\Nseem to be the case here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.82,0:23:40.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.53,0:23:43.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 29: "The Untainted Child"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.74,0:23:47.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, I saw it—
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.91,0:23:51.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the old scar on his shoulder.
